<phyphox version="1.8" locale="en">
  <title>Transit Method</title>
  <category>*Astrolab University of Cologne</category>
    <icon format="base64"></icon>
  <description>Study model transit light curves with a phone light sensor, TI SensorTag or solar cell and Owon multimeter. Select one source, measure local background and plateau means, and use projected geometry for radius inference. Timing uses lower/upper normalized crossings and reports available complete threshold durations and onset intervals.</description>

